        "README": {
          "description": "This workbook contains the final curated datasets used in this study: S1336 includes 1,336 protein–DNA mutation records, and S599 includes 599 protein–RNA mutation records. Both sheets provide experimental ΔΔG values, mutation and sequence information, source datasets, publication PMIDs, and affinity measurement methods where available. Structural resolution is reported in Å to one decimal place; resolution is not applicable to NMR structures. The final column identifies records included in the comparison subsets S441 and S260, respectively."
        },
